6. what is re-ranking -------------- -----------------------------  ✅

In generative AI, re-ranking is the process of taking an initial list of candidate outputs (such as search results, recommendations, or generated answers) and reordering them to improve quality, relevance, or diversity. It acts as a refinement step after retrieval or generation, ensuring the final output better matches user needs.

