10. Reduce Hellogenation -------------------------  ✅

• Ground responses with retrieval (RAG) 📚 → Connect the model to external knowledge bases or documents so it generates answers based on real sources.

• Verification layers ✅ → Add fact-checking models or re-ranking steps to confirm outputs against trusted data.
• Prompt design 🎯 → Use clear, structured prompts that encourage evidence-based answers and allow the model to say “I don’t know.”
• Fine-tuning & RLHF 🔧 → Train with curated datasets and human feedback to discourage unsupported claims.

• Constrained decoding & filters 🛡️ → Apply rules or filters to block unsafe or unverified outputs.

• Human-in-the-loop 👩‍💻 → For sensitive domains (medical, legal, finance), always review outputs before use.


