12. Keyword search and vector search different -------------------------  ✅

• Keyword Search 🔍 → Finds documents by exact word matches. It’s fast and simple but misses meaning (e.g., “car” ≠ “automobile”).
• Vector Search 🧭 → Finds documents by semantic meaning using embeddings. It understands context and synonyms but is more computationally heavy.

